  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Follow-up interventions circular packaging</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to give more direction to the outcomes of the systems mapping study on circular packaging. The outlined interventions need follow-up in terms of urgency, quick wins and linkages with the combi-track on agro-logistics and sea freight.With a four-week assignment, the embassy could get a better idea of how to proceed with the interventions listed in the mapping and the possibilities to make this part of the combi-track.</narrative>
  </description>
